sive sums of cash muzon lives a  pretty lavish life so he needs some way  to pay for it gyotaro is interestingly  enough the real upper moon 6 not daki  kaigaku was able to master most of the  thunder breathing forms however he was  unable to master the first form though  unconfirmed this could be a result of  him having his scabbard on his back as  opposed to his waist where the form  tends to launch from kagaku also has an  interesting choice in accessories with  his tome away bracelets and necklace  these change color between his human and  demon lies going from yellow to dark  blue which shows his fall from good to  bad the tomoy is also represented on  raijin the god of lightning's drums  which alludes to the thunder breathing  style gyoko is the only upper moon that  we did not get a backstory for in the  manga  nakime upper moon 4 and kyogai former  lower moon 6 each use sound-based blood  demon arts which can affect their  environments  we've seen one member of the upper moons  and one member of the lower moons see  their loved ones after death these being  rui and akasa akas attacks tend to be  named after fireworks a reference to his  lost love koyuki to see fireworks  together  on a similar note akaza is also the only  demon given specific permission to not  fight or kill women by muzon finally  akaza is also the only demon moon to  fight barehanded doma is the one who  turned daki and gyotoro into demons  and finally kokushibo has been  challenged for the title of upper moon 1  3 times usually he opts to absorb those  he defeats however the third time was  with akuza and he enjoyed the challenge  so much that he allowed him to live  and there you have it 50 facts all about  the demon slayer story that you might  have missed watching through again let  me know what you thought of these how  many you knew and how many you thought  were really interesting or just what  your favorite was and hey if you have  any fun demon slayer facts or things  that we migh